flowchart TD
    A[Customer scans product] --> B[Create / update cart]
    B --> C[Check available inventory]
    C --> D[Reserve requested quantity]
    D --> E[Checkout]

    E --> F[Create payment attempt]
    F --> G{Payment status}

    G -->|Success| H[Confirm transaction]
    H --> I[Convert reservation to SOLD]
    I --> J[Update inventory]
    J --> K[Generate receipt]
    J --> L[Create inventory event]
    L --> M[Check stock threshold]
    M --> N{Below threshold?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Create low-stock alert]
    N -->|No| P[No alert]

    G -->|Failed| Q[Release reservation]
    Q --> R[Return stock to AVAILABLE]

    G -->|Expired / Cancelled| S[Release reservation]
    S --> R

    F --> T[Idempotency check]
    T --> U{Already processed?}
    U -->|Yes| V[Return existing transaction result]
    U -->|No| F
